    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "coach_teacher_health_trade_02_03",
      "hash64": "E8A974A0469E31B3",
      "text": "无法使用异色宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "coach_teacher_health_trade_03_00",
      "hash64": "13948B94FD927AF7",
      "text": "你的同行宝可梦\\n只有一只啊。\\r\\n这样是没法交换的。\\r\\n带２只以上的宝可梦再来吧～[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
