    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "coach_teacher_health_battleend_win_01_00",
      "hash64": "C09B0560620422D9",
      "text": "好，做个紧急处理……\\n还有这个，你也拿去吧。[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
